[en.FOCUS_C12_GREAT_ROCKVILLE]
Declare the Great Rockville

[en.FOCUS_C12_GREAT_ROCKVILLE_desc]
The territory of the rock farm has now expanded significantly, and our ties with Cozy’s empire have been completely severed. A new and better name will replace the so-called "Rock Farm Autonomous Territory," showcasing the supreme status of myself and the Pie-Apple family. Moreover, it will serve as a constant reminder to both my enemies and the ponies of the land of the achievements I have attained.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_GREAT_ROCKVILLE]
宣告成立大洛克维尔

[zh.FOCUS_C12_GREAT_ROCKVILLE_desc]
如今采石农场的领土已经越发广泛，也与可西的帝国一刀两段，一个更好的名字将会替代所谓的“采石农场自治领”，从而彰显我和苹果派家族至高无上地位，并且让我的敌军和马民时时刻刻感受我所取得的成就

